{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_chat_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_095_synopsis", "source_sha256": "868310e193d1af0b9a0a16b18d5826a5490fe3f9410defa30dc115829fc1db4a", "ja": "なし", "zh": "无", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_chat_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_095_1000_006mak", "source_sha256": "6f3f263e1a20fd4346b8082fcc627cbd6620f99fc8cf60ed52afb1c8dc95554a", "ja": "この前のエレナの新曲、\nすごくよかったよね！\nなんだか見違えちゃった。", "zh": "前阵子艾琳娜的新歌，\n真的很棒呢！\n感觉她简直判若两人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_chat_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_095_1001_009rit", "source_sha256": "c4a6be815eb0463dd6b428e72b7f4d9bda7741d762e1d1fad3606222942f77e4", "ja": "普段のエレナとは違う一面が\n見られたって感じだったわね。\n琴葉も、見学してたんでしょ？", "zh": "感觉看到了平时的艾莲娜所没有的另一面呢。\n琴叶也去旁听了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_chat_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_095_1002_017kth", "source_sha256": "65343eec30cd03bdd5c810a9a9bacbeac7d55f159ec71ef0adb9862308a698ac", "ja": "はい！　私も驚いて……。\n次は私の新曲お披露目なので、\nすこしプレッシャーです。", "zh": "是的！我也吓了一跳……  \n接下来就要公开我的新歌了，所以稍微有点压力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_chat_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_095_1003_006mak", "source_sha256": "fddb1b336e1ab09f6ec9ce2b4f3d0a9e1e1d51c38c51c6e136330d27b73b6121", "ja": "新曲かあ……楽しみだね！\nどんな曲か、もう聴いたの？", "zh": "新歌啊……真让人期待！\n是什么样的歌，已经听过了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_chat_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_095_1004_017kth", "source_sha256": "a0c4039fcb7714407fd7362431c90b7567aae4cafba331ccf0c3ebf6940b122c", "ja": "ううん。今日のミーティングで、\n聴かせてもらう予定なの。\n楽しみだけど、緊張するな……。", "zh": "不是哦。今天开会时，\n我打算听一下那首歌。\n虽然很期待，但还是有点紧张……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
